MAJOR_VERSION=5
STANDARD_VERSION=3
RELEASE_VERSION=0
PRERELEASE=1
RERELEASE=1
DEV_VERSION=13
DESCRIPTION=Fix make baremetal link failure for fl_kq_driver_get (#421). Hosted bare-metal builds still compile KeyQuorum checkpoint objects under FL_WITH_KEYQUORUM, but driver_model.c gated FL_MODEL_RESOLVES_KQ behind !DRIVERS_BAREMETAL, so fl_kq_driver_get was undefined while kq_checkpoint.o and fl_kq_driver_get_or_register still called it. The model now resolves KeyQuorum whenever FL_WITH_KEYQUORUM or FL_LAB_KQ is set; bus enumeration and register_all still skip KeyQuorum under DRIVERS_BAREMETAL. Versioning: introduce RERELEASE=1 so a prerelease row may reuse an existing A.B.C + DEV_VERSION (here 5.3.0 BUILD 13) without bumping RELEASE_VERSION; uniqueness CI and AI/docs policy updated accordingly.
